v><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="InlineCodePane-EYx4bd w-full overflow-x-hidden"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full Viewer-ALA646" dir="ltr"><div class="chatgpt-code-scrollport flex w-full items-stretch overscroll-x-contain Scrollport-kY3Nlm overflow-x-auto"><pre class="m-0 flex-1 cursor-text px-4 pb-3 font-mono text-size-code text-default md:px-5 ViewerContent-Cg8AgN pt-0 min-w-max whitespace-pre"><code><span class="text-codex-syntax-attribute">.title-container </span><span>{
